+`aeeddd6a...`; the provisional primary audit `3935d763...`; the imported ML,
+GGV and GGHV statements at exactly their recorded scopes; the already
+accepted F2 source/receiver chain and accepted15q. The unseen live joint-gate
+verdict is not a premise of this report.
+
+**Cheapest discriminator.** Finish and collect the already launched
+different-model joint gate under receipt-first custody. Do not commission a
+duplicate review. The reviewer must decide separately: (i) ML applies to the
+given representative; (ii) the proportional-rectangle and inverse-degree
+argument has no cancellation; (iii) Proposition 5.20 preserves the required
+ordinary endpoint/degrees without a successor or minimality hypothesis; (iv)
+the published table is exhaustive at `a+b<=25`; and (v) the selected F2
+starting triple enters the accepted forward map. This is a prose/source gate,
+not a solver or table recomputation.
+
+**Outcomes and disposition.** `CONFIRMED`: root may promote at the imported-
+theorem trust tier; **continue** global source work, but **stop** the `M2=90`
+child build, every `(75,125)` counterexample solve, and any B0 properness run.
+`GAP`: retain the strongest verified prefix and **redesign** only at the first
+missing arrow; if the incoming theorem no longer covers all actual pairs,
+extract the exact `M2=90` source signature as the single fallback. `REFUTED`:
+bank the actual countercontrol or false line, restore the fixed-degree source
+gap, and do not infer survival of any coefficient family. `INCONCLUSIVE`:
+status quo, no descendant. **Stop condition:** one terminal verdict with all
+five arrows typed. **Required authority:** root alone may collect, promote,
+or launch the fallback. Cross review has none. **Expected gain:** very high;
+it decides the whole actual fixed-degree source before local work.
